# Join a Link Cable room whose host speaks another link protocol (an older
# GBAdhoc): no WELCOME while the room's radio cell is there -> the version
# failure on the LINKING screen.
+60 menu
+10 press DOWN
+4 press DOWN
+4 press CROSS
+10 press DOWN
+4 press CROSS
+40 dump x-version-scan
+4 press CROSS
+1 wait failscreen
+10 dump x-version-fail
+4 press CIRCLE
+20 exit 0
